==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Magneton|59}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Lightning Ball''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Lanturn|20}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

